Diet Planning Assistant (Streaming & Persistent Chatbot)
A fully functional, multi-turn conversational AI chatbot built with Python, LangChain, Gradio, and SQLite. This application features real-time token streaming using Python generators and robust database persistence to save and load past chat sessions.

