🚀 Key Features
Real-Time Token Streaming: Utilizes Python generators (yield) and LangChain's .stream() method to deliver responses chunk-by-chunk, lowering perceived latency and creating a natural conversational feel.

Database Persistence: Automatically tracks message history across application sessions using SQLChatMessageHistory backed by SQLite.

Session Management: Built-in controls to start a fresh chat (🆕 New Chat) or switch seamlessly between past conversations via a dynamic dropdown.

Structured System Instructions: Guided by prompt engineering to keep the assistant focused on balanced meal planning and asking one question at a time.

